<title>USA: Photran target of class action - attorney.</title>
<headline>Photran target of class action - attorney.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>An attorney for the purchasers of Photran Corp common stock during a nearly one-year period said Wednesday a class action has been filed alleging that the company's actions artificially inflated its stock prices during that period.</p>
<p>The attorney said the period is between  May 29, 1996, and May 24, 1997.</p>
<p>The attorney said the action was filed in United States District Court for the district of Minnesota.</p>
